cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Oxide, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Oxide"
abstract: >-
  Oxide is an open-source desktop app for agentic coding. It drives the
  coding agent CLIs already installed on the user's machine (Claude Code,
  Codex and Antigravity CLI) and focuses on the path from a finished agent
  Turn to a confident merge: line comments, blind review by a second agent, and Git and GitHub integration.
authors:
  - family-names: Cavallini
    given-names: Lorenzo
  - name: "The Oxide contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/getoxide/oxide"
url: "https://github.com/getoxide/oxide"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agentic coding
  - AI coding agents
  - Claude Code
  - Codex
  - code review
  - desktop app
  - Tauri
  - Rust
